# README.md and environment.yml stay tracked; *.vtu results are already
# covered by the global *.vtu rule above).  The .nc is 123 MB.
safs/project_7.0_alternative/seisol_quakeworx/toolbox/**/*.nc
# SeisSol setup-dir large regenerable inputs (each setup dir carries its own
# generators): safs_material_cvm.nc (107 MB, > GitHub's 100 MB hard limit) is
# built by the dir's convert_cvm_to_asagi.py and is byte-identical to the
# toolbox-generated copy; safs_mesh.puml.h5 (49 MB) is built from the
# already-ignored *.msh (run_nwcut_meshing.py) via build_and_run_pumgen_linux.sh
# + retag_msh_to_seissol.py — see MESH_BUILD_README.md in each setup dir.
safs/project_7.0_alternative/seisol_quakeworx/safs_seisol_v*/safs_material_cvm.nc
safs/project_7.0_alternative/seisol_quakeworx/safs_seisol_v*/safs_mesh.puml.h5

